      "id": "step-4",
      "number": 4,
      "heading": "Bake the greens",
      "blocks": [
        "Seal the greens, half the garlic, butter, pepper and {{greens-water}} cold water in a foil parcel. Bake on a separate tray 10–12 minutes until tender. Use two parcels for three or more servings."
      ],
      "notes": [],
